            "notes": "The main concept of this control deck is to manipulate the board state using Aminatou's ability to blink key cards, disrupt opponents with counterspells and hand disruption spells, and control the game with removal spells. The deck includes a variety of versatile creatures and enchantments that can generate card advantage, control the battlefield, and provide value. By leveraging Aminatou's ability to flicker permanents, the deck can protect its key threats, reuse powerful effects, and outvalue opponents in the long game. The deck aims to grind out advantage over time, disrupt opponents' strategies, and eventually win through incremental advantage or a combo finish."
